sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant BS as Booking Service
    participant Redis as Redis (Seat Lock)
    participant DB as Booking DB
    participant Q as Kafka
    participant N as Notification Svc

    U->>BS: POST /book {eventId, seatId, userId}
    BS->>Redis: SET lock:seat:seatId userId NX EX 600
    alt lock acquired
        Redis-->>BS: OK
        BS->>DB: INSERT booking (PENDING, idempotency_key)
        DB-->>BS: booking_id
        BS->>BS: Process Payment
        alt payment success
            BS->>DB: UPDATE booking → CONFIRMED
            BS->>Redis: DEL lock:seat:seatId
            BS->>Q: publish booking.confirmed
            Q->>N: send confirmation email/push
            BS-->>U: 200 booking_id
        else payment failed
            BS->>DB: UPDATE booking → FAILED
            BS->>Redis: DEL lock:seat:seatId
            BS-->>U: 402 Payment Failed
        end
    else lock not acquired
        Redis-->>BS: nil (seat taken)
        BS-->>U: 409 Seat Unavailable
    end
